  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tKAI0\n\t\n\n\n  \n    \n  \n  \n    \n  \n  \n    \n  \n\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tTODO\n\t\n\n\n The advantage label will be coming soon.\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tContents\n\t\n\n\nAbout the Dataset\nLoad the Dataset\nDownload the Dataset\nDataset Structure\nFolder hierarchy\nDetails\n\n\nLicense and Citation\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tAbout the Dataset\n\t\n\n\n~134 hours real world scenarios \n\nMain Tasks\n\nTask_A\nSingle task\nInitial state: T-shirts are randomly tossed onto the table, presenting random crumpled configurations\nManipulation task: Operate the\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/balatubs123/kumagong.",
